  "description": "Focus for the match AI of every champion: when the game's AI attacks an enemy champion while another visible one no farther away is low (25% health or less, and lower than the target) or much weaker (under 50% and 30 points below the target), the attack goes to the weakest such champion. Only attacks on champions change: no chasing, no dives; skills, minions and buildings are untouched. Log: league_focus.log.\n\n集火：游戏 AI 普攻一个敌方英雄时，看得见、不比它更远的另一个敌方英雄残血（25% 以下且比目标血少）或明显更弱（50% 以下、比目标少 30 个百分点），就改打其中血最少的。只换普攻目标，不追人、不越塔；技能、小兵、建筑都不动。日志 league_focus.log。",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-08",
  "mod_id": "league_focus",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: focus (finish the weaker champion)",
  "version": "0.1.1"
}